# AnatomyLens needs no environment variables or API keys.
# Never put credentials here or in frontend source.
# VITE_* variables are PUBLIC in a normal Vite build; this app disables custom
# environment exposure entirely. Built-in DEV/MODE/BASE_URL are not secrets.
# Any future secret API integration must use a separately secured backend and
# server-only environment variables. Do not add a key to the browser app.
